.TH "ANIMATIONEVENT.ANIMATION" "3JS" "July 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
AnimationEvent.animation \- AnimationEvent: animation property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]animation\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]AnimationEvent\f[R] interface represents the animation associated
with the event.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSAnimation\f[R], or \f[CR]null\f[R].
.SH SEE ALSO
.IP \(bu 2
Using CSS animations
.IP \(bu 2
Animation\-related CSS properties and at\-rules: \f[CR]animation\f[R],
\f[CR]animation\-delay\f[R], \f[CR]animation\-direction\f[R],
\f[CR]animation\-duration\f[R], \f[CR]animation\-fill\-mode\f[R],
\f[CR]animation\-iteration\-count\f[R], \f[CR]animation\-name\f[R],
\f[CR]animation\-play\-state\f[R],
\f[CR]animation\-timing\-function\f[R], \f[CR]\(atkeyframes\f[R].
.IP \(bu 2
The \f[CR]AnimationEvent\f[R] interface it belongs to.
